flowchart LR
    G[GitHub trusted release] -->|OIDC| D[Scoped AWS deployment roles]
    D -->|immutable upload| A[S3 release artifacts]
    D -->|Terraform workload apply| J[Glue Spark job]
    O[Authorized operator] -->|snapshot manifests and profile| J
    A -->|launcher and wheel bundle| J
    I[S3 input snapshot] -->|read only| J
    R[S3 reference snapshot] -->|read only| J
    K[KMS keys and policies] -.-> A
    K -.-> J
    J -->|unique attempt outputs| S[S3 decisions candidates quarantine]
    J -->|conditional publish last| M[S3 committed manifest]
    M --> C[Authorized consumer]
    S -->|only paths named in manifest| C
    J --> L[CloudWatch logs and metrics]
    J -->|state change| E[EventBridge failure rule]
    E --> N[SNS operations notification]
